# the grid's Take-off (REC held, white 10: was DUB-1's Crash): the arc's Crash ending's noise falling into the echo, at
# about the music's own level, never far over it (1.3.0: DUB-1's was white noise 15 dB over the music)
listen
wait 6000
peakreset
wait 3000
expect peak_db_max <-14
press REC
wait 300
key w9 down
wait 200
key w9 up
release REC
said Take-off
peakreset
wait 1500
expect peak_db_max <-12
